  Learner->>BookingAPI: Pick confirmed UTC slot
  BookingAPI->>BookingAPI: Teacher UTC overlap lock
  BookingAPI-->>Teacher: Booked UTC and teacher local display
  BookingAPI-->>Learner: Booked UTC and learner local display
